      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "22",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giijasta Yeremiya weesa gheeda sugoocheanda Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA: “Rarang'eesiina gheeda sugoocheanda Yuda ak giyeeshi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Aleaydiit ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA, Ea sugoocheanda Yuda, ang'iing'eeda iibiiti uhuuda hoorgeeda Dawdi, ang'iing'i, sea fugaagu bea gadiyeeda, sea fugaagu oosigayi gidaghuudajeesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA: Asina huumeanda ea doobiiwnata ak goolealu aba geatinda siida ghabwas fih. Adiidu goosisi gea munyas nea ghoaluuji rabascheanda, ghana bananeeda ghana masinung'weanda, nea adiidu ghoahiidi foojeanda manda giidiinyeanda aba hiji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak inyas ghoang'waanyi ng'asheanji, abeeda gaygwasigu gidaghuudajeegeaba gheawi sugoodiga abiita iheenga hoorgeeda Dawdi, ding'iida mutukwajeega ea faraasajeega, saawa ea fuga nyaawa bea gadiyeeda, ea sea fuga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA; aba inyas ea moang'waanyi ng'asheesu, abeeda ghaayaaji habeawooda aba ghuuteanyu, gideaba gheawi gayghoah raghoonyeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA aba badayda gheeda sugoocheanda Yuda:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“‘Ak gaygwasik murdeedeaba mujiineani eemoojiga saang'a, ak gaygaba siisi eesha dea mida murdeadaanyi, “Ghwasaan NG'UTAMIIDA nisima ng'asheanji mujiineani hawiini?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak hean gayghwasha nea gwayi, “Aba gideaba gwajakta neajeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA nyaawa, ak gaweay ghabwat sanaamajeega nea gagadiiyeesa.”’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giijasta Yeremiya aba badayda Yoahasi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nih gidarugu NG'UTAMIIDA gil aba badayda Yohasi orjeeda Yosiya, was sugoocheanda Yuda, weah hoorgeeda ghwaan goombaliischi, was dea weewa hiji, “Maygudu gabiigu hiji gicha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean gaygameewsa ng'eanyiida ghayi siyaat ghoah giing'oonyaneeda, nea ea maygudu ghwadaah ng'eanyiini gicha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giijasta Yeremiya aba badayda Yehoyakimu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA aba badayda Yehoyakimu orjeeda Yosiya was sugoocheanda Yuda:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giijasta Yeremiya bea gichea gabussa Yerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Girgweageeda ASEETA aba badayda Yehoyakimu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, “Aba gideabiideati, earapeadi Goniya orjeeda Yehoyakimu, was sugoocheanda Yuda, guwuurjeewi ghuniida geatindeanyu bea dugwa hean gaydang'awnyi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghaayiinyeey geatinda fuga gasa eaweagaagu, ea geatinga fuga iwalayi, ea heeda geatinga sugoocheanda Babeli siguura Nebukadinesa ea heeda geatinga fuga Galdayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydahooseegwa ang'iing'i ea geamadu ng'eanyiida sheagi, ghayi meejiilseegwa, ak gajameewsiina hoowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ng'eanyiida jea ang'weelsiina gideaba gajabiikta, Ea majoamuusa abiikni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
